  "notes": "USAGE:\n- {追肥|ついひ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧/{追肥|ついひ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to apply additional fertilizer)\n- {追肥|ついひ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{与|あた}える→与える：01821_ataeru⟧ (to give additional fertilizer)\n\nGARDENING CONTEXT:\n{追肥|ついひ} contrasts with {元肥|もとひ}/⟦{元肥|もとごえ}→元肥：26356_motogoe⟧ (base fertilizer applied before or at planting). Plants often need supplemental nutrition during active growth.\n\nTYPES OF FERTILIZER:\n- ⟦{液肥|えきひ}→液肥：26357_ekihi⟧ (liquid fertilizer)\n- {化成肥料|かせいひりょう} (chemical fertilizer)\n- ⟦{有機肥料|ゆうきひりょう}→有機肥料：26530_yuukihiryou⟧ (organic fertilizer)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {元肥|もとひ} (base fertilizer)\n- ⟦{肥料|ひりょう}→肥料：06102_hiryou⟧ (fertilizer)\n- ⟦{施肥|せひ}→施肥：26188_sehi⟧ (fertilization)",
